__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.wav

# Voice models: tens of MB each, installed by setup_voices.py
voices/
*.onnx
*.onnx.json

# Runtime state, not source. myfam.db holds listener interaction history and
# was tracked by accident - it churns on every run and should never be shared.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
preview/fam-preview.html
preview/fam-artifact.html
attachments.db

# The launcher installs into here; it is per-machine, never committed.
.fam-venv/

# The reference recording a pod bundle carries. Someone's voice, extracted
# from a tarball for one run - never committed. (*.wav is already ignored
# above; this covers the minimal rights record beside it.)
pod-voice/
fam-pod.tar.gz

# What a pod run writes back. Copied to the Mac, then read - not committed
# from the pod, which has no credentials and should not get any.
pod-results/

# macOS writes one of these into every folder it displays. It is never source,
# on any branch, and it is what a Finder window leaves behind rather than
# anything anyone did.
.DS_Store

# `experiments/` is tracked content of `claude/fam-repo-inventory-5lznba`, not
# of this branch. It is deliberately absent from production: the experiment
# layer is not a production dependency, and nothing in app.py imports it.
#
# What is left on disk after switching to this branch is the part of it git
# never tracked even there - `experiments/runs/`, `experiments/packets/`,
# `experiments/baselines/`, `experiments/chunks/` and, most importantly,
# `experiments/references/`, which holds the reference recordings and the
# sources.json that maps neutral ids back to the people who recorded them.
#
# So: do not delete it (reference_3.wav lives there and is irreplaceable), and
# do not commit it here (it is somebody's voice, and this is the production
# branch). Ignoring it says the true thing - on this branch it is not part of
# the tree - and leaves the files exactly where they are.
#
# If genuinely new experiment source is ever written on this branch, this line
# would hide it. Add it with `git add -f`, or reconsider the line.
experiments/
ios/FAM.xcodeproj/
ios/build/
ios/fastlane/.env
ios/fastlane/report.xml
ios/fastlane/Preview.html
ios/fastlane/screenshots
ios/fastlane/test_output
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
